webpages (choose your own link depth) onto your Palm. So I have Jeroen
Kuiper's English-Lojban dictionary on mine. I use SuperMemo for
memorization, but not for lookup because it seems to sort slowly, so I
also have the word lists in there as Documents-to-Go.

If any of this is interesting yet opaque, drop a line & I'll include the links.

